  "solution": {
    "text": "Pitch of helical path is,<br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mn>45</mn><mo>°</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />Also radius of helix is,<br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />or <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>",
